WEBVTT

01:45.120 --> 01:47.800
YONG'AN PAVILION

02:01.880 --> 02:03.080
MEMORIAL TABLET
OF NOBLE CONSORT LIU YUNXIAN

02:09.720 --> 02:11.280
Are you scared now?

02:12.000 --> 02:14.440
Don't worry, I won't kill you.

02:15.040 --> 02:16.840
Chancellor Jiang is still outside.

02:16.920 --> 02:18.120
I don't want

02:18.200 --> 02:20.920
to be arrested for the crime of harming
the Chancellor's daughter.

02:38.960 --> 02:40.600
Why exactly are you bringing me here?

02:41.760 --> 02:44.200
Be patient. Take it slow.

03:05.040 --> 03:07.400
Go and take a closer look.

03:43.080 --> 03:44.600
Xue Zhao?

03:51.920 --> 03:52.880
What do you think?

03:53.680 --> 03:56.520
Are you surprised
that Xue Zhao is still alive?

03:57.920 --> 04:01.400
I always like having an ace up my sleeve.

04:02.000 --> 04:04.480
To prevent the Xue family
from taking revenge against me,

04:05.520 --> 04:08.560
I have imprisoned him here all along.

04:14.280 --> 04:16.720
Since it has come to this,
let's lay everything out in the open.

04:17.480 --> 04:21.360
Xue Fangfei, do you want
to save your brother?

04:24.880 --> 04:25.800
I don't know her.

04:33.840 --> 04:36.520
Whether you know her or not
is just a test away.

04:42.640 --> 04:43.600
Wanning.

04:45.440 --> 04:47.160
Wanning!

04:49.880 --> 04:50.840
Wanning!

04:55.000 --> 04:56.000
Stop!

05:00.720 --> 05:03.040
Stop.

05:04.800 --> 05:05.760
Tell me.

05:08.240 --> 05:09.680
What do you want me to do?

05:13.520 --> 05:16.040
Shen Yurong in exchange for Xue Zhao.

05:17.360 --> 05:20.240
If you retract your testimony
during the trial, he'll be free.

05:23.640 --> 05:25.360
What if you don't release him?

05:25.880 --> 05:28.320
Why would I leave him alive?

05:29.360 --> 05:30.920
So Xiao Heng could investigate me?

05:32.640 --> 05:37.480
Who do you think you are
to negotiate with me?

05:39.440 --> 05:41.160
Since it's a negotiation,

05:44.240 --> 05:45.640
I'll state my request too.

05:47.120 --> 05:48.200
From this moment on,

05:49.000 --> 05:51.280
you are not allowed to lay a hand on him.

05:52.280 --> 05:55.400
Otherwise, we shall perish together.

06:06.000 --> 06:09.960
You do your part,
and naturally, I'll do mine.

06:24.840 --> 06:25.680
Xue Zhao.

06:27.240 --> 06:28.080
Xue Zhao.

06:56.720 --> 06:57.640
Li'er.

06:59.600 --> 07:02.440
Chancellor Li, sorry to make you wait.

07:03.240 --> 07:05.840
We had a girls' talk

07:06.440 --> 07:08.800
and really got along, right?

07:10.760 --> 07:11.680
Yes.

07:12.480 --> 07:15.760
Ms. Jiang Li, come and have tea
with me again next time.

07:30.080 --> 07:30.920
Li'er,

07:32.640 --> 07:34.720
what did the Eldest Princess do to you?

07:38.120 --> 07:39.480
I'm fine, Father.

07:39.560 --> 07:42.480
I had some conflict
with Her Highness before,

07:42.560 --> 07:44.640
but realized it was
a misunderstanding later on.

07:44.720 --> 07:46.160
I didn't have time to explain to you.

07:46.720 --> 07:48.440
When she found out
about what happened to me,

07:49.000 --> 07:51.560
she comforted me and even apologized.

08:13.080 --> 08:14.320
Stop!

08:14.400 --> 08:16.160
- Help me.
- Stop!

08:16.720 --> 08:19.040
Xue Li, help me.

08:19.760 --> 08:20.960
Help me.

08:21.640 --> 08:22.720
Release him!

08:22.800 --> 08:23.720
- My lady.
- Xue Zhao!

08:24.840 --> 08:26.240
My lady, what's wrong?

08:31.520 --> 08:32.360
Prepare ink for me.

08:32.440 --> 08:33.280
Yes.

08:42.760 --> 08:45.520
Deliver this letter to Jiuyue urgently.

08:45.600 --> 08:47.320
Leave only after she finishes reading it.

08:47.400 --> 08:48.240
My lady,

08:48.720 --> 08:51.520
did something happen
at Eldest Princess' Mansion?

08:51.600 --> 08:52.960
Do I need to inform Duke Su?

08:53.040 --> 08:55.800
You don't need to inform him about this.

08:57.960 --> 08:59.000
Yes.

09:07.280 --> 09:08.920
My lord, Zhao Ke sent news,

09:09.000 --> 09:10.960
saying Ms. Jiang Li told him
to deliver a letter to Jiuyue.

09:11.040 --> 09:12.640
Why does she need Jiuyue?

09:12.720 --> 09:14.600
Should I retrieve the letter?

09:14.680 --> 09:15.720
There's no need.

09:15.800 --> 09:18.200
You make me sound like a scoundrel
who likes spying on people.

09:18.280 --> 09:21.160
Zhao Ke said Ms. Jiang Li
looked distracted after leaving

09:21.240 --> 09:22.440
Eldest Princess' Mansion.

09:22.520 --> 09:25.000
The Eldest Princess must have
discussed something with her.

09:26.520 --> 09:28.520
Send more men to keep an eye on Wanning.

09:29.040 --> 09:30.760
Notify me at once on news
about the Jiang family.

09:30.840 --> 09:31.920
Yes.

09:38.040 --> 09:39.280
COURT OF JUDICIAL REVIEW

09:39.360 --> 09:41.920
I, Jiang Yuanbai, have served
in the Imperial Court for many years.

09:42.000 --> 09:44.800
Never did I imagine
such an absurd hardship

09:44.880 --> 09:46.680
would befall my daughter.

09:46.760 --> 09:50.400
At the banquet held at the Shen Residence,
in full view of everyone,

09:50.480 --> 09:54.120
Shen Yurong went against ethical norms

09:54.200 --> 09:58.040
and attempted
to sexually assault Jiang Li.

09:58.120 --> 10:01.760
He doesn't deserve the official uniform
bestowed upon him by His Majesty.

10:01.840 --> 10:05.080
Shen Yurong has no shame!

10:05.160 --> 10:08.200
Chancellor Jiang, we know you're upset.

10:08.280 --> 10:10.520
When an official
is involved in such a scandal,

10:10.600 --> 10:11.640
we are also angry.

10:11.720 --> 10:14.360
But don't worry, Chancellor Jiang.

10:14.440 --> 10:16.640
In the past few days, I have questioned

10:16.720 --> 10:18.200
the witnesses present at the scene,

10:18.280 --> 10:20.760
and they have all truthfully recounted

10:20.840 --> 10:21.840
what happened that day.

10:22.320 --> 10:24.280
With both witnesses
and physical evidence in place,

10:24.840 --> 10:28.920
once we confirm
Ms. Jiang Li's statement one more time,

10:29.000 --> 10:31.320
Shen Yurong can be convicted.

10:31.400 --> 10:32.480
Good.

10:35.160 --> 10:37.480
Li'er, go.

10:39.640 --> 10:40.920
CONFESSED CRIMINAL: SHEN YURONG
VICTIM

10:47.400 --> 10:49.480
SHEN YURONG

11:01.880 --> 11:04.040
I want you to tell everyone

11:04.760 --> 11:06.520
you seduced Shen Yurong.

11:07.000 --> 11:10.640
Just say you admire Mr. Shen.

11:11.440 --> 11:13.240
and you expressed your feelings to him

11:14.040 --> 11:15.960
during the celebration banquet
at his residence.

11:16.040 --> 11:18.920
After getting rejected,
you got embarrassed and angry.

11:20.040 --> 11:22.680
That was why you injured him.

11:25.960 --> 11:27.080
Li'er.

11:27.160 --> 11:28.320
I cannot

11:31.880 --> 11:32.800
sign this document.

11:33.840 --> 11:35.040
You--

11:36.160 --> 11:37.280
Why?

11:39.200 --> 11:40.040
Because…

11:42.920 --> 11:43.760
I've always

11:45.080 --> 11:46.520
admired Mr. Shen.

11:49.040 --> 11:50.360
During the banquet…

11:52.560 --> 11:53.400
Jiang Li.

11:54.160 --> 11:56.280
Be mindful of what you say

11:56.360 --> 11:58.120
in front of
Court of Judicial Review Minister.

11:59.400 --> 12:03.280
I wanted to express my feelings
to Mr. Shen at the banquet.

12:04.240 --> 12:06.280
I was rejected
and it caused a misunderstanding.

12:06.760 --> 12:09.120
Why didn't you explain back then?

12:10.080 --> 12:10.920
It was too sudden.

12:11.920 --> 12:14.760
I panicked
and didn't have time to explain.

12:15.760 --> 12:19.320
In the past few days,
I've been feeling guilty.

12:21.160 --> 12:23.240
I don't want Mr. Shen to suffer
because of me.

12:23.800 --> 12:28.000
That's why I'm here today
to clear Mr. Shen's name.

12:29.040 --> 12:31.440
I hope Mr. Shen
would forgive my unintended mistake.

12:32.680 --> 12:36.360
This was solely my doing.

12:37.920 --> 12:38.760
Ms. Jiang Li,

12:39.240 --> 12:41.440
I don't care about your intention
for saying this,

12:42.000 --> 12:43.360
but I'll give you one more chance.

12:43.880 --> 12:45.400
Think carefully before you speak again,

12:46.360 --> 12:50.480
or this can't be resolved
by just saying it's a misunderstanding.

12:50.560 --> 12:53.840
You previously claimed
that Shen Yurong tried to molest you

12:53.920 --> 12:57.360
and you injured him in self-defense.

12:57.920 --> 13:00.760
There are also witnesses
who have given their statements.

13:01.400 --> 13:04.280
If you retract your testimony now,
Shen Yurong will be innocent.

13:05.160 --> 13:09.240
On the contrary, your crime of falsely
accusing Imperial Court officials

13:09.800 --> 13:11.280
is a serious offense.

13:11.880 --> 13:15.680
So you need to think carefully.

13:16.520 --> 13:20.560
I've thought it through. That's the truth.

13:26.280 --> 13:27.360
I'm sorry, Chancellor Jiang.

13:27.920 --> 13:29.320
If it's indeed as she says,

13:30.000 --> 13:32.000
this case will be resolved differently.

13:32.480 --> 13:35.200
Today, Ms. Jiang Li
retracted her testimony herself.

13:35.280 --> 13:37.760
There's no doubt about her guilt
and no need for a trial.

13:37.840 --> 13:40.200
The Court of Judicial Review
must discuss the sentence now

13:40.280 --> 13:42.320
and submit it
to the Ministry of Justice for approval.

13:42.400 --> 13:45.120
Therefore, the Jiang family
cannot supervise her at home

13:45.200 --> 13:47.160
like you did last time.

13:49.280 --> 13:52.760
Li'er, did the Eldest Princess
threaten you?

13:52.840 --> 13:54.040
Tell us.

13:56.040 --> 13:56.960
Or

13:57.880 --> 13:59.200
do you have any concerns?

13:59.280 --> 14:01.760
I simply spoke truthfully
about my own wrongdoing

14:02.520 --> 14:04.000
and cleared Mr. Shen's name.

14:05.240 --> 14:06.080
Guards!

14:08.160 --> 14:09.000
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:09.080 --> 14:09.920
Take her away.

14:10.000 --> 14:10.840
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:48.280 --> 14:49.120
My lord,

14:49.200 --> 14:51.600
Jiang Yuanbai just brought Ms. Jiang Li
to the Court of Judicial Review.

14:51.680 --> 14:54.400
But for some reason,
she retracted her testimony

14:54.480 --> 14:55.640
and was detained on the spot.

14:55.720 --> 14:56.640
What?

15:09.400 --> 15:10.240
Gentlemen,

15:11.000 --> 15:13.200
can I have a word with Ms. Jiang Li?

15:18.760 --> 15:21.280
You really found
a nice backer for yourself.

15:22.760 --> 15:24.480
She insisted on saving you at all costs.

15:24.560 --> 15:26.040
I never asked her to save me.

15:26.600 --> 15:29.240
She captured my brother
and tortured him every day

15:29.840 --> 15:30.680
in a secret dungeon.

15:31.320 --> 15:32.720
Don't you know about that?

15:32.800 --> 15:33.640
Xue Zhao?

15:35.160 --> 15:36.000
Is he still alive?

15:36.080 --> 15:38.160
Drop the act now, Shen Yurong.

15:38.240 --> 15:41.560
You're so close. How could she
possibly hide that from you?

15:41.640 --> 15:43.320
I really didn't know.

15:43.400 --> 15:45.720
She exchanged my brother for you.

15:46.360 --> 15:47.360
Shen Yurong,

15:47.440 --> 15:51.000
after you leave,
don't just indulge in pleasure.

15:52.120 --> 15:54.920
Keep in mind
that each moment you're living

15:55.520 --> 15:58.360
comes at the cost
of the Xue family's suffering.

15:58.440 --> 15:59.640
Is that the kind of person

16:01.400 --> 16:02.920
you think I am?

16:03.480 --> 16:05.120
I once believed your conscience was intact

16:05.920 --> 16:07.120
and gave you a chance.

16:07.920 --> 16:09.920
However, you still chose Wanning.

16:10.920 --> 16:15.040
I wish you two happiness then.

16:15.800 --> 16:17.040
I didn't choose her.

16:19.160 --> 16:21.520
I just can't abandon my mother and sister.

16:23.520 --> 16:24.560
Of course I know that.

16:26.560 --> 16:28.280
It's just like how you abandoned me,

16:29.960 --> 16:32.520
my father, and my brother,

16:33.920 --> 16:34.760
right?

16:35.440 --> 16:37.560
I won't have any expectations of you
from now on.

16:38.440 --> 16:39.680
I'll eventually expose

16:40.680 --> 16:42.400
all the evil deeds you've done
to the public.

16:45.440 --> 16:46.280
Li.

16:53.080 --> 16:55.320
Don't call me that again.

16:55.840 --> 16:58.080
This time, I find it disgusting for real.

17:58.880 --> 18:02.080
Is this what you call
being forced by circumstances again?

18:04.600 --> 18:05.520
I need your help

18:07.320 --> 18:08.280
regarding something.

18:10.080 --> 18:11.760
Now, you think about asking for my help?

18:11.840 --> 18:13.480
You're the only person I trust to do this.

18:14.800 --> 18:15.640
What is it?

18:16.280 --> 18:19.000
Pick up my brother
at Eldest Princess' Mansion.

18:19.080 --> 18:20.280
Xue Zhao is still alive?

18:21.040 --> 18:22.520
But he's worse than dead.

18:24.080 --> 18:25.240
After I get him, then what?

18:26.120 --> 18:26.960
What about you?

18:27.440 --> 18:28.840
I'm waiting for Jiuyue's reply.

18:31.280 --> 18:35.080
If possible, please urge her.

18:36.280 --> 18:37.120
Are you not afraid?

18:38.520 --> 18:39.880
This isn't the first time.

18:40.840 --> 18:42.480
Duke Su, please make sure

18:42.560 --> 18:44.120
my brother is safe first.

18:44.200 --> 18:46.640
The little civet
isn't adorable when it cries.

18:56.200 --> 18:57.040
Duke Su,

18:57.520 --> 18:59.920
you even came personally
to pick that person up?

19:00.000 --> 19:00.840
Where is he?

19:00.920 --> 19:02.960
I've already sent him to your mansion.

19:03.040 --> 19:05.760
DUKE SU'S MANSION

19:05.840 --> 19:08.440
DUKE SU'S MANSION

19:09.520 --> 19:10.520
Duke Su,

19:11.080 --> 19:13.640
how could I possibly
let you and your people

19:13.720 --> 19:17.120
see Xue Zhao walk out of here
with your own eyes?

19:17.200 --> 19:18.760
I thought you'd continue

19:19.720 --> 19:22.040
to keep this card in your hands.

19:23.840 --> 19:24.920
Duke Su,

19:25.000 --> 19:27.000
you don't know me at all.

19:27.560 --> 19:30.840
I keep my promises.

19:31.840 --> 19:35.040
Besides, the show has just begun.

19:36.240 --> 19:38.480
Killing him and ending it all is so easy.

19:39.600 --> 19:41.520
How could I let her have her way?

19:42.280 --> 19:44.680
I want her to see her brother

19:44.760 --> 19:46.840
become a useless cripple.

19:47.760 --> 19:51.240
That's far more devastating
than simply killing him.

19:55.160 --> 19:56.800
I'm afraid you're going
to be disappointed.

19:58.360 --> 19:59.520
What do you mean?

20:02.240 --> 20:03.760
She isn't as greedy as you.

20:04.320 --> 20:06.880
As long as he's alive,
that's enough for her.

20:41.040 --> 20:43.320
Don't call me that again.

20:43.840 --> 20:45.640
This time, I find it disgusting for real.

21:01.320 --> 21:02.160
Yurong?

21:08.760 --> 21:10.360
Mother asked me to bring you dinner.

21:12.760 --> 21:13.880
Have the servants

21:14.520 --> 21:16.600
clean up the room I used to stay in.

21:18.120 --> 21:19.760
Are you moving back?

21:19.840 --> 21:22.760
Yes, I'm moving back.

21:23.320 --> 21:24.160
That's great.

21:24.240 --> 21:26.200
Would you like me
to add anything there for you?

21:32.120 --> 21:32.960
There's no rush.

21:48.840 --> 21:52.120
You've become thinner
and look even better.

21:52.680 --> 21:54.200
Your Highness, you've also lost weight.

22:01.040 --> 22:02.200
Have you thought it through?

22:02.280 --> 22:03.600
Yes.

22:04.640 --> 22:08.040
I failed you in prison. I deserve to die.

22:08.720 --> 22:11.520
Tell me. What do you plan to do?

22:12.280 --> 22:13.920
Xue Fangfei won't be sentenced to death.

22:14.560 --> 22:18.240
The Jiang family and Xiao Heng
will find ways to save her.

22:18.880 --> 22:20.200
She won't be imprisoned for long.

22:20.680 --> 22:21.720
So?

22:21.800 --> 22:23.520
As long as Xue Fangfei's
in the Jiang family,

22:23.600 --> 22:24.800
no one can lay a finger on her.

22:24.880 --> 22:26.560
We should get her out of there first

22:27.160 --> 22:28.440
and place her in the Shen family.

22:30.640 --> 22:31.520
What do you mean?

22:31.600 --> 22:35.360
I want to request His Majesty
to grant Xue Fangfei and my marriage.

22:36.080 --> 22:37.040
What did you say?

22:37.640 --> 22:38.560
I said

22:39.160 --> 22:43.520
I want to request His Majesty to grant
Xue Fangfei and my marriage.

22:44.120 --> 22:45.760
Has this always been a part of your plan,

22:46.480 --> 22:48.920
to reunite with your Mrs. Shen?

22:51.040 --> 22:53.840
She ruined me, leaving me with nothing.

22:55.520 --> 22:56.760
It was you who saved me

22:57.720 --> 22:59.680
and restored my honor and future.

22:59.760 --> 23:00.600
I'm not a fool.

23:01.760 --> 23:03.680
Why would I want to reunite with her?

23:05.920 --> 23:07.560
If you have a wife,

23:08.720 --> 23:10.480
how will you be my Prince Consort?

23:11.520 --> 23:12.840
Your Highness is a princess.

23:13.560 --> 23:15.120
If you were to marry me in the future,

23:15.720 --> 23:17.320
we can demote her from wife to maid.

23:18.240 --> 23:20.640
That way, she can serve you forever.

23:20.720 --> 23:22.560
Your Highness, don't you want to see her

23:23.080 --> 23:24.600
grovel at your feet?

23:26.600 --> 23:27.920
Do you hate her that much?

23:28.480 --> 23:31.600
I have no one but you now.

23:32.840 --> 23:33.760
What does that mean?

23:42.000 --> 23:42.960
Stand up and speak.

23:49.040 --> 23:50.480
Adorn Your Highness with accessories

23:51.040 --> 23:52.480
and pin your hair, my darling.

24:00.400 --> 24:01.480
"My darling"?

24:11.240 --> 24:13.920
This is the first time
you've given me a gift.

24:14.000 --> 24:15.840
That's because you're noble

24:16.880 --> 24:20.280
and have everything, including me.

24:49.080 --> 24:50.720
It's rare to smile
in this troubling world,

24:51.400 --> 24:53.480
go back full of chrysanthemums
on your head when in full bloom.

25:05.560 --> 25:07.560
You really went to great lengths

25:08.280 --> 25:10.120
to persuade me to agree to the marriage.

25:10.640 --> 25:12.680
The marriage is just an act,

25:12.760 --> 25:15.280
ultimately aimed to please you,
Your Highness.

25:18.000 --> 25:19.160
If the Jiang family disagrees,

25:20.320 --> 25:22.800
the emperor won't force them.

25:22.880 --> 25:24.160
That's why we need someone else

25:24.760 --> 25:26.720
to bring this up to His Majesty.

25:27.320 --> 25:28.160
Who?

25:28.240 --> 25:29.440
Consort Li.

25:36.840 --> 25:39.400
This is indeed an available pawn.

25:49.880 --> 25:51.480
DUKE SU'S MANSION

25:58.840 --> 25:59.680
How is he?

26:00.520 --> 26:01.520
His injuries are serious,

26:01.600 --> 26:02.720
but not life-threatening.

26:02.800 --> 26:04.280
Currently, he is asleep after taking

26:04.360 --> 26:05.440
some calming medicine.

26:05.520 --> 26:07.080
What did the physician say about his leg?

26:08.280 --> 26:09.200
Can it be healed?

26:09.280 --> 26:12.680
The physician said he might need
to use crutches for the rest of his life.

26:18.840 --> 26:20.120
Have you looked into Zhou Dezhao?

26:20.200 --> 26:21.120
Is there anything on him?

26:21.760 --> 26:24.080
No. He has always been impartial.

26:24.880 --> 26:27.680
Ms. Jiang Li's false accusation
against an official is already confirmed.

26:27.760 --> 26:29.240
The Court of Judicial Review
is currently discussing the sentence.

26:29.320 --> 26:30.520
How did the Jiang family react?

26:31.160 --> 26:32.280
A scout found out

26:32.360 --> 26:34.280
that the Chief Secretariat
went to His Majesty,

26:34.760 --> 26:36.360
but was told to go to Zhou Dezhao.

26:36.440 --> 26:39.360
So the Chief Secretariat is
at the Court of Judicial Review every day.

26:40.480 --> 26:42.800
It seems like His Majesty intends
to be a bystander.

26:46.320 --> 26:47.320
Prepare my carriage.

26:58.160 --> 26:59.880
Your Highness, Eldest Princess is here.

27:01.640 --> 27:03.120
Consort Li.

27:05.520 --> 27:08.560
It's indeed rare for Your Highness

27:09.360 --> 27:10.880
to visit me personally.

27:10.960 --> 27:12.720
I'm a bit late.

27:13.840 --> 27:17.000
I should have come earlier
to offer my regards

27:17.080 --> 27:19.920
when Mrs. Jiang was in trouble.

27:20.920 --> 27:22.560
Your Highness must be here

27:23.160 --> 27:24.800
for a reason.

27:24.880 --> 27:25.720
Speaking of which,

27:25.800 --> 27:28.040
if you didn't use my sister as a pawn,

27:28.120 --> 27:30.080
she wouldn't have ended up
in such a situation.

27:30.560 --> 27:32.320
Even if I hadn't teamed up with her,

27:32.920 --> 27:35.480
she would have clashed fiercely
with Jiang Li anyway.

27:35.560 --> 27:37.360
She isn't Jiang Li's match.

27:37.920 --> 27:39.760
It was Jiang Li who brought harm
to Mrs. Jiang.

27:40.320 --> 27:42.280
What's the point
of talking about this now?

27:42.880 --> 27:44.720
I have an idea

27:46.320 --> 27:48.760
for you to avenge your sister.

27:49.320 --> 27:51.240
It depends on whether you're willing.

27:52.160 --> 27:53.000
Tell me.

27:53.080 --> 27:54.760
Request His Majesty to grant marriage

27:55.400 --> 27:56.880
between Jiang Li and Shen Yurong.

27:56.960 --> 27:57.920
Grant marriage?

27:59.720 --> 28:00.760
What do you mean?

28:01.360 --> 28:04.320
The Chief Secretariat
treasures his daughter dearly

28:04.400 --> 28:06.080
and the Jiang family protects her,

28:06.720 --> 28:08.120
so we can't do anything to her.

28:08.720 --> 28:10.480
But Shen Yurong is on my side.

28:10.560 --> 28:11.960
If she goes to the Shen family,

28:12.040 --> 28:13.880
then we'll have control over her.

28:14.440 --> 28:16.880
That does sound like a good idea.

28:17.360 --> 28:20.760
However, I won't let you use me as a pawn

28:21.400 --> 28:23.200
like you did to my sister.

28:23.280 --> 28:26.360
How could I possibly use you as a pawn?

28:27.040 --> 28:29.800
At most, I'll just threaten you.

28:30.760 --> 28:31.600
What?

28:32.360 --> 28:33.840
I heard

28:35.520 --> 28:38.240
that there was an evil spirit
in the harem before

28:39.240 --> 28:41.840
and the Imperial Diviner Office
went to perform exorcism.

28:43.040 --> 28:45.680
For some reason, Consort Xian

28:45.760 --> 28:47.040
passed away.

28:47.920 --> 28:49.520
Aside from the Imperial Diviner,

28:50.520 --> 28:53.000
everyone involved
in the Imperial Diviner Office

28:53.080 --> 28:55.000
all resigned and returned
to their hometowns.

28:56.080 --> 28:57.480
That's so strange.

28:58.520 --> 28:59.720
Where did they go?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.640
You know about it

29:02.320 --> 29:04.480
and I know too.

29:04.560 --> 29:06.640
Speaking of which, I must thank you.

29:06.720 --> 29:07.800
If it weren't for you,

29:07.880 --> 29:11.600
I wouldn't have thought
of this trick of exorcism,

29:12.560 --> 29:16.000
which made your sister end up like that.

29:21.760 --> 29:24.040
Do you think I'll be afraid of you?

29:24.760 --> 29:27.040
You didn't root out the problem back then,

29:27.120 --> 29:30.280
so it's too late to be ruthless now.

29:31.800 --> 29:34.160
You sent a palace maid
who knew about the incident back home.

29:34.720 --> 29:37.880
Later on, I found her.

29:38.760 --> 29:40.440
With a little coercion,

29:40.520 --> 29:43.920
she would surely disclose the whole truth
to His Majesty.

29:44.000 --> 29:45.920
Simply persuading His Majesty

29:46.000 --> 29:47.480
to grant a marriage

29:48.320 --> 29:50.840
is certainly easier than explaining

29:50.920 --> 29:54.280
why you killed Consort Xian.

29:55.400 --> 29:56.480
Once the matter is settled,

29:56.960 --> 29:59.800
I will promptly return
that palace maid to you

30:00.480 --> 30:01.840
to handle as you see fit.

30:04.000 --> 30:05.560
Why are you still standing there?

30:06.400 --> 30:07.600
Come over and have some tea.

30:15.560 --> 30:17.480
Is Your Majesty really
staying out of Jiang Li's case?

30:18.080 --> 30:19.120
Do you really think

30:19.200 --> 30:21.520
I have nothing better to do
than meddle in such a minor case?

30:21.600 --> 30:23.760
What if Wanning is involved in this?

30:23.840 --> 30:25.160
I told you

30:26.000 --> 30:27.880
to watch over your pawn well.

30:28.440 --> 30:30.040
Why would you need a dead pawn?

30:30.560 --> 30:31.560
What's the rush?

30:31.640 --> 30:33.320
They have yet to make a move, right?

30:36.160 --> 30:38.800
Xiao Heng, concern causes confusion.

30:40.480 --> 30:41.520
Your Majesty,

30:42.040 --> 30:44.200
Consort Li invites you
to a stroll in the imperial garden.

30:45.400 --> 30:46.680
I should take a break.

30:46.760 --> 30:47.760
You can head back first.

30:48.280 --> 30:51.840
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

30:51.920 --> 30:53.720
I think your pawn

30:55.000 --> 30:56.600
is calmer than you.

31:09.600 --> 31:11.000
Shen Yurong has entered the palace.

31:14.240 --> 31:15.320
Continue watching him.

31:15.400 --> 31:17.000
Inform me as soon as there is any news.

31:17.080 --> 31:17.920
Yes.

31:20.120 --> 31:21.160
Your Majesty,

31:21.240 --> 31:22.800
it has been a while

31:22.880 --> 31:24.880
since we took a stroll together.

31:26.760 --> 31:27.760
Yes.

31:27.840 --> 31:29.640
I've been too busy lately.

31:29.720 --> 31:31.760
I just finished dealing
with Great Zhao's alliance

31:31.840 --> 31:33.480
and there are matters to be handled.

31:33.560 --> 31:35.240
Are you talking about Ms. Jiang Li

31:35.320 --> 31:36.640
and Mr. Shen's incident?

31:37.320 --> 31:39.520
The incident between them
is causing quite a stir.

31:39.600 --> 31:42.120
It seems like the Shen and Jiang families
are on bad terms too.

31:42.200 --> 31:43.840
Mr. Shen and the Chief Secretariat

31:43.920 --> 31:45.840
are both trustworthy
Imperial Court officials.

31:45.920 --> 31:47.840
They are both important to me.

31:47.920 --> 31:48.880
I'm in a dilemma too.

31:49.920 --> 31:51.400
I have an idea.

31:52.080 --> 31:54.000
It can solve your concerns

31:54.080 --> 31:56.160
and satisfy both
the Jiang and Shen families.

32:00.280 --> 32:03.000
Well, Li'er is
my sister's daughter after all.

32:03.080 --> 32:04.920
Even if they had misunderstandings

32:05.000 --> 32:05.880
in the pasat,

32:06.520 --> 32:09.000
I've always considered Li'er my niece.

32:09.560 --> 32:11.800
Look, a lady

32:11.880 --> 32:12.960
goes to prison.

32:13.040 --> 32:15.920
Her dignity and reputation are all gone.

32:16.000 --> 32:17.240
It's heartbreaking to see this,

32:18.080 --> 32:20.320
so I sent someone to check
what happened with Mr. Shen,

32:20.400 --> 32:22.880
only to find out
it was all a misunderstanding.

32:27.240 --> 32:28.320
What's wrong, Your Majesty?

32:30.360 --> 32:31.560
I was thinking

32:31.640 --> 32:33.080
what kind of misunderstanding it was.

32:33.160 --> 32:35.920
I've sent someone to invite Mr. Shen here.

32:36.000 --> 32:38.360
Why don't we let him
explain to you in person?

32:39.880 --> 32:40.720
Sure.

32:44.880 --> 32:45.840
Greetings, Your Majesty.

32:47.320 --> 32:48.720
Greetings, Your Highness Consort Li.

32:48.800 --> 32:52.320
Consort Li told me what happened between
you and Jiang Li was a misunderstanding.

32:52.400 --> 32:53.880
It was my fault.

32:54.600 --> 32:55.800
After all, in this matter,

32:55.880 --> 32:57.640
a lady's reputation is more important.

32:57.720 --> 33:00.840
I believe Ms. Jiang Li was just confused

33:01.400 --> 33:02.800
and had no malicious intent.

33:03.360 --> 33:05.480
I also implore Your Majesty to pardon her

33:05.560 --> 33:07.360
and refrain
from pursuing this matter further.

33:07.880 --> 33:09.800
Do you truly not mind?

33:11.920 --> 33:13.960
I naturally won't hold it
against Ms. Jiang Li.

33:14.600 --> 33:16.680
Mr. Shen is a gentleman

33:16.760 --> 33:18.240
who's magnanimous.

33:19.080 --> 33:20.920
He'll make a wonderful husband.

33:23.600 --> 33:25.040
With this incident,

33:25.120 --> 33:27.680
Li'er's reputation
will likely be tarnished.

33:27.760 --> 33:29.480
After she made such a mistake,

33:29.560 --> 33:31.600
it may be difficult
for her to marry a good man.

33:32.560 --> 33:34.120
She previously professed affection

33:34.200 --> 33:36.360
for Mr. Shen.

33:36.440 --> 33:39.320
Since Mr. Shen doesn't mind what she did,

33:40.040 --> 33:40.920
why don't Your Majesty

33:41.000 --> 33:43.080
grant them marriage?

33:43.160 --> 33:44.880
It can not only resolve this matter,

33:44.960 --> 33:46.640
but also preserve Li'er's reputation.

33:52.640 --> 33:53.720
But this would indeed

33:54.640 --> 33:56.760
be quite unfair to Mr. Shen.

33:56.840 --> 33:59.240
If it can preserve
Ms. Jiang Li's reputation,

34:00.720 --> 34:04.240
I'm willing to heed Consort Li's words.

34:10.320 --> 34:11.600
Marriage is a major matter.

34:12.719 --> 34:14.760
Naturally, I must ask
the Chief Secretariat's opinion.

34:15.360 --> 34:17.400
But since Mr. Shen agreed
not to pursue the matter…

34:17.480 --> 34:20.159
Issue a decree to the Court
of Judicial Review to dismiss the case,

34:20.239 --> 34:22.639
release Jiang Li,
and let the Jiang family take her.

34:22.719 --> 34:23.840
Yes.

34:24.400 --> 34:26.840
I will ask the Chief Secretariat.

34:27.400 --> 34:29.520
If both families agree to this,

34:29.600 --> 34:31.440
I am more than willing to accumulate merit

34:31.520 --> 34:33.000
by arranging a good match.

34:34.320 --> 34:35.920
Sure, let's do as you say.

34:37.320 --> 34:39.320
I am willing to go to the prison
to pass the decree

34:39.400 --> 34:41.159
and escort Ms. Jiang Li home.

34:42.360 --> 34:43.560
Go ahead.

34:52.719 --> 34:54.280
They want His Majesty to grant marriage.

34:55.159 --> 34:56.920
So that's what they want to happen.

34:57.440 --> 34:59.880
My lord, should we return to the palace
or head to the prison?

35:00.440 --> 35:02.480
- Let's go to the prison directly.
- Yes.

35:10.440 --> 35:11.880
Ms. Jiang Li, you may go.

35:35.320 --> 35:36.280
I'll escort her out.

35:36.360 --> 35:37.360
Yes, Mr. Shen.

35:43.720 --> 35:45.920
You've suffered in the past few days.

35:48.440 --> 35:49.640
Will you marry me?

35:55.640 --> 35:56.720
Are you crazy?

35:57.520 --> 35:58.680
Aren't you curious

36:00.320 --> 36:01.920
about why you were released?

36:02.640 --> 36:04.240
His Majesty intends to grant us marriage.

36:05.320 --> 36:06.800
We love each other,

36:06.880 --> 36:09.600
so what you did was not a crime.

36:10.840 --> 36:14.800
Is this your plan from the beginning?

36:15.920 --> 36:16.840
Yes.

36:17.400 --> 36:18.840
So you married me before,

36:19.400 --> 36:20.480
killed me once,

36:21.440 --> 36:22.920
and now you're marrying me again

36:23.440 --> 36:24.480
to kill me once more?

36:26.240 --> 36:27.240
What if I say

36:29.280 --> 36:30.680
I'm protecting you this time?

36:31.960 --> 36:33.120
Do you believe that?

36:33.680 --> 36:34.520
I do.

36:35.520 --> 36:37.440
Your words merely disgust me.

36:46.880 --> 36:47.720
Xue Li,

36:48.320 --> 36:49.520
you can choose not to believe me,

36:49.600 --> 36:51.160
but His Majesty's decree can't be defied.

36:51.640 --> 36:52.560
I'll take you home first.

36:53.040 --> 36:54.240
Think carefully about what I said.

36:54.880 --> 36:56.320
Your carriage leads to death.

36:56.920 --> 36:58.400
I dare not ride it again.

36:58.480 --> 37:00.080
Are you planning to walk back
to Jiang Residence?

37:18.360 --> 37:20.120
Someone will escort me.

37:50.000 --> 37:51.200
My hand is cramping.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.720
Loosen your grip a bit.

37:56.360 --> 37:57.440
I won't move around.

38:17.360 --> 38:19.920
Just now, Shen Yurong said

38:20.000 --> 38:22.160
that His Majesty wants
to grant my marriage with him.

38:22.240 --> 38:23.240
I heard about it.

38:24.240 --> 38:25.800
It was Consort Li who proposed it.

38:26.840 --> 38:28.320
Why did she get involved?

38:29.480 --> 38:31.800
Is she Wanning's ally?

38:32.360 --> 38:34.520
In the past, she wasn't.
But now, I'm not certain.

38:35.000 --> 38:36.600
I've already sent someone to investigate.

38:36.680 --> 38:38.960
Consort Li should know
the risk of working with Wanning.

38:40.000 --> 38:41.440
Ji Shuran's downfall

38:41.520 --> 38:43.640
was partly due to Wanning's failure.

38:44.440 --> 38:46.480
Now that Consort Li is willing
to help Wanning,

38:47.360 --> 38:49.000
there must be
some hidden motive behind it.

38:49.080 --> 38:50.280
Don't overthink it for now.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.760
Let's wait for news from the scouts.

38:52.680 --> 38:54.760
I'll take you to my mansion first
to see your brother.

38:55.240 --> 38:58.360
While we're at it, prepare an excuse
to tell the Jiang family.

39:03.120 --> 39:05.840
DUKE SU'S MANSION

39:10.840 --> 39:11.680
Xue Li.

39:12.440 --> 39:13.280
Xue Zhao.

39:25.320 --> 39:26.160
Xue Li.

39:28.000 --> 39:29.800
Everyone is saying that you're dead.

39:30.760 --> 39:31.960
I thought you were dead too.

39:32.640 --> 39:33.480
And Father.

39:34.440 --> 39:35.680
Did you see him?

39:35.760 --> 39:37.120
Does he know what happened to us?

39:39.680 --> 39:40.600
He does.

39:42.480 --> 39:43.400
Father is doing well.

39:45.120 --> 39:46.760
What about the gold mine on East Mountain?

39:46.840 --> 39:47.720
Are they still mining?

39:47.800 --> 39:48.960
No.

39:49.880 --> 39:51.240
They're not, Xue Zhao.

39:52.200 --> 39:53.560
You did a good job.

39:53.640 --> 39:56.040
The map you drew saved many lives.

39:56.640 --> 39:57.520
I'm glad to hear that.

39:58.240 --> 40:00.400
Xue Li, I want to ask…

40:00.480 --> 40:01.360
That's enough.

40:02.480 --> 40:04.000
First, focus on recovering.

40:05.000 --> 40:07.160
I'll tell you everything later,

40:07.760 --> 40:08.600
all right?

40:10.640 --> 40:11.480
Xue Zhao,

40:14.480 --> 40:16.360
I'm not Xue Fangfei now.

40:17.680 --> 40:18.960
I have a new identity.

40:19.680 --> 40:21.120
I'm Jiang Yuanbai's daughter,

40:22.240 --> 40:23.400
Jiang Li.

40:23.960 --> 40:24.840
Jiang Li?

40:29.880 --> 40:30.880
Xue Li,

40:31.720 --> 40:33.320
I didn't know you suffered so much.

40:34.680 --> 40:35.800
It's all in the past now.

40:36.760 --> 40:39.400
Having you and Father alive

40:40.440 --> 40:41.880
makes me so happy.

40:43.000 --> 40:44.240
As for you,

40:44.320 --> 40:46.600
why did I hear you were killed by bandits?

40:49.720 --> 40:51.120
After receiving the letter that day,

40:52.200 --> 40:53.760
I didn't want Father to worry,

40:55.080 --> 40:57.320
so I went to the capital alone
to find out the truth.

40:59.360 --> 41:00.680
I felt something was amiss,

41:01.640 --> 41:03.560
so I had someone write
to the capital's governor.

41:05.000 --> 41:06.200
Unexpectedly, on the way there,

41:06.280 --> 41:07.760
I encountered a gang of bandits.

41:14.000 --> 41:15.120
Who is lying in ambush here?

41:15.840 --> 41:17.080
Show yourselves now!

41:53.040 --> 41:54.160
When I woke up,

41:54.240 --> 41:56.560
I found myself in the Eldest
Princess' Mansion's secret dungeon.

41:56.640 --> 41:57.600
I only discovered later

41:57.680 --> 41:59.360
that the Eldest Princess was behind this.

41:59.440 --> 42:01.280
She never showed herself before,

42:02.040 --> 42:04.080
and just locked me there
with an indifferent attitude.

42:05.320 --> 42:06.160
I thought

42:07.000 --> 42:09.080
I'd die there without anyone finding out.

42:09.920 --> 42:12.000
I never thought someone
would come to my rescue.

42:12.080 --> 42:14.800
Now, I even get to see you again.

42:14.880 --> 42:16.400
Father is also in the capital.

42:16.480 --> 42:17.560
It seems like the heavens

42:18.360 --> 42:20.480
still left a way
for the Xue family to survive.

42:21.240 --> 42:23.800
Xue Li, they say
that after hardship comes comfort.

42:23.880 --> 42:25.400
We've endured hardships,

42:25.480 --> 42:26.320
so surely better days

42:26.840 --> 42:28.000
lie ahead for us.

42:28.720 --> 42:30.000
Focus on recovering first.

42:30.480 --> 42:32.880
If you need anything, send someone
to Jiang Residence to find me.

42:33.440 --> 42:35.360
I need to go back
and handle some matters now.

42:35.920 --> 42:36.760
All right.

43:05.360 --> 43:07.440
Father, I'm back.

43:07.520 --> 43:09.280
I knew you were coming back,

43:09.960 --> 43:11.760
so I was planning to go pick you up.

43:12.280 --> 43:14.360
However, you weren't there.

43:15.160 --> 43:17.480
Duke Su came to pick me up.

43:18.360 --> 43:20.600
He asked me about the details of the case,

43:21.280 --> 43:22.360
so that took some time.

43:22.440 --> 43:25.560
Why is Duke Su
suddenly involved in this matter?

43:26.120 --> 43:28.040
Maybe because it's related
to the Eldest Princess,

43:28.720 --> 43:30.200
so he came to ask some questions.

43:30.280 --> 43:32.800
I know you and Duke Su

43:32.880 --> 43:34.480
often contact each other.

43:34.560 --> 43:37.520
Since you trust him,
I won't say much more.

43:37.600 --> 43:40.120
But you changed your testimony.

43:40.200 --> 43:43.040
Does Wanning have something on you?

43:43.600 --> 43:46.440
I know that because
of what happened in the past,

43:47.320 --> 43:49.000
you don't trust me at all.

43:52.160 --> 43:54.200
But we're still father and daughter.

43:54.280 --> 43:56.800
If you need anything,
you can always come to me.

43:56.880 --> 43:58.560
Even if the sky were to fall,

43:59.360 --> 44:00.960
I'd protect you.

44:01.640 --> 44:04.280
This sudden change in testimony

44:04.360 --> 44:05.720
must have embarrassed you.

44:06.320 --> 44:08.080
I thought you'd reprimand me.

44:08.640 --> 44:11.200
I know your temperament.

44:13.640 --> 44:16.680
Your actions may seem reckless,

44:16.760 --> 44:18.600
but you always have your reasons.

44:19.240 --> 44:21.280
Since I've decided
to come back and help you,

44:21.360 --> 44:23.200
I've also decided to trust you.

44:23.280 --> 44:25.400
If you want to explain, go ahead.

44:25.480 --> 44:27.800
If you don't, just tell me

44:27.880 --> 44:30.240
what I can do to help.

44:30.320 --> 44:31.160
Father,

44:32.200 --> 44:36.240
the matter with the Eldest Princess
has been resolved,

44:36.320 --> 44:37.880
so there's no need for you to worry.

44:38.840 --> 44:42.200
However, there's a more
urgent matter at hand now.

44:43.160 --> 44:44.520
What is it?

44:44.600 --> 44:48.600
His Majesty intends to grant marriage
between me and Shen Yurong.

44:48.680 --> 44:50.120
When did that happen?

44:50.200 --> 44:52.600
I just heard it from Shen Yurong
while I was in prison earlier.

44:53.560 --> 44:54.760
What are your thoughts?

44:54.840 --> 44:55.840
I don't want to.

44:57.240 --> 45:00.520
However, His Majesty
has already agreed to grant the marriage.

45:01.200 --> 45:02.680
But a formal decree isn't issued yet.

45:03.400 --> 45:06.200
Consort Li will be handling the specifics.

45:06.280 --> 45:07.640
Consort Li is also the one

45:07.720 --> 45:09.480
who asked His Majesty
to grant this marriage.

45:24.800 --> 45:26.880
Her sudden involvement in this matter

45:27.680 --> 45:29.520
shows that she has ulterior motives.

45:29.600 --> 45:31.200
His Majesty granting a marriage

45:32.000 --> 45:33.520
brings glory to one's ancestors.

45:34.720 --> 45:35.960
From past dynasties until now,

45:36.040 --> 45:38.040
no one ever refused a granted marriage.

45:38.680 --> 45:39.520
The groom

45:40.000 --> 45:41.320
is Shen Yurong,

45:41.400 --> 45:43.200
whom I claim to have feelings for.

45:45.080 --> 45:47.160
If you refuse the granted marriage,

45:47.680 --> 45:49.280
Consort Li will make
a huge issue out of it.

45:49.760 --> 45:50.840
Defying the imperial decree

45:51.600 --> 45:53.160
could place you in a difficult position.

45:54.880 --> 45:56.160
Is Mother doing well now?

45:56.840 --> 45:58.680
Aside from being disoriented,

45:58.760 --> 45:59.600
she's fine.

46:00.360 --> 46:02.880
Mother and Consort Li need to meet up now.

46:03.520 --> 46:06.480
Given Ji Shuran's current condition,

46:06.560 --> 46:08.440
I'm afraid she can't persuade Consort Li.

46:09.240 --> 46:10.360
Let's give it a try first.

46:11.080 --> 46:12.480
Please make the arrangement, Father.

46:14.360 --> 46:16.000
No problem.

46:25.680 --> 46:28.560
My lord, I've found
the information you requested.

46:28.640 --> 46:29.480
The scout reported

46:29.560 --> 46:31.360
overhearing Wanning and Consort Li

46:31.440 --> 46:33.720
discussing the evil spirit incident
in the palace years ago.

46:36.440 --> 46:37.640
The death of Consort Xian?

46:38.240 --> 46:40.160
Yes, the scout reinvestigated

46:40.240 --> 46:41.880
and realized there's more to it.

46:43.360 --> 46:44.400
Any evidence?

46:44.480 --> 46:46.880
We're still checking
if any released palace maids back then

46:46.960 --> 46:48.120
knew what happened.

46:49.120 --> 46:51.080
Since Wanning has approached Consort Li,

46:52.240 --> 46:54.320
she likely has the witness in hand.

46:55.200 --> 46:56.960
Start investigating around her.

46:57.040 --> 46:59.160
Should we inform His Majesty about this?

46:59.760 --> 47:00.720
There's no need.

47:00.800 --> 47:02.360
His Majesty may be in the know.

47:02.960 --> 47:05.600
Then we need to conduct
the investigation discreetly,

47:05.680 --> 47:06.760
but it might take some time.

47:07.280 --> 47:08.840
By the time we find out the truth,

47:08.920 --> 47:10.760
Consort Li might already
get the marriage granted.

47:14.720 --> 47:15.840
I'll quickly investigate now.

47:20.760 --> 47:22.400
Tell Li about this news.

47:22.480 --> 47:23.400
Yes.
